      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَفِينَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing buried:</i> (Th, K:) and hence,
(TA,) <i>a treasure,</i> or <i>a buried treasure:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَفَائِنُ</span>:
(M, K, TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَفِينٌ</span></b>  also signifies <i>buried
treasure.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ركز</span>.)

